        "thought_text": "Instead of storing individual stone counts and recalculating for each query, we can use mathematical properties of modular arithmetic to calculate the total number of stones in a range efficiently. This approach will significantly reduce time complexity and avoid the output mismatch error.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-2372821695417324824",
